============================================
  VolleyMe Backend Server
============================================

Project directory:
  cd /opt/volleyme

View logs:
  1. Check service name in docker-compose.yml
  2. Use docker compose logs:

  # Follow logs in real-time
  docker compose logs -f volleyme-backend

  # Logs from the last 30 minutes
  docker compose logs --since 30m volleyme-backend

  # Logs since a specific timestamp
  docker compose logs --since 2026-04-27T14:00:00 volleyme-backend

